<title>UK: Allied Colloids lifts H1 pfts, div.</title>
<headline>Allied Colloids lifts H1 pfts, div.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		2.84		   vs 2.81</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 0.64		   vs 0.58</p>
<p> Pretax		     21.1		   vs 20.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   207.5		  vs 190.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Chemicals group Allied Colloids Plc said its general market outlook was &quot;encouraging, with the exception of textiles where it continues to be depresed.&quot; It said it expected sales in the second half of the year to be higher than in the first half, with October sales up 11 percent year-on-year.  </p>
<p> Tax			  5.9		    vs 5.5</p>
<p> Retained		   11.7		   vs 11.8</p>
<p> Pay date		   Feb 14, 1997</p>
<p>Div registration date  Dec 3</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
